ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleWindows=Apply MD3 style to vanilla window borders
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleWindowsDesc=When enabled, all vanilla windows use the MD3 rounded card background with a primary-colored border. Only the appearance changes.
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleCommands=Apply MD3 style to command buttons (draft/resign/attack, etc.)
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleCommandsDesc=When enabled, the bottom command bar buttons (draft, resign, attack, and all gizmo buttons) use the MD3 rounded background. Only the appearance changes.
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleMenuSections=Apply MD3 style to menu sections & list rows
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleMenuSectionsDesc=When enabled, vanilla menu sections and list blocks (drug/food policies, surgery list, ideology list, etc.) use the MD3 rounded card. Only the appearance changes.
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleSchedule=Apply MD3 style to the schedule (time assignment) bar
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleScheduleDesc=When enabled, the time assignment buttons in the Schedule tab use the MD3 pill style with the primary color for the selected one. Only the appearance changes.
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleInspectPane=Apply MD3 style to the inspect pane + fix bar overlap
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleInspectPaneDesc=When enabled, the bottom-left inspect pane content uses the MD3 card background, and the status bars no longer overlap the title area. Only the appearance changes.
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleStatistics=Apply MD3 grouped cards to the statistics page
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleStatisticsDesc=When enabled, the History tab Statistics page shows the stats grouped into MD3 cards (basics/wealth/raids/casualties/ending). Only the appearance changes.
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleIdeo=Apply MD3 style to the ideology menu (culture rows & meme cards)
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleIdeoDesc=When enabled, the Ideology tab culture rows and the meme cards use the MD3 rounded outline (primary for the selected one). Only the appearance changes.
ModernExpandMenu_BorderOutline=Plain outline
ModernExpandMenu_BorderMarquee=Primary marquee
ModernExpandMenu_BorderRainbow=Rainbow flow
ModernExpandMenu_BorderStyleDesc=Choose the border style of the menus (right-click menu and all vanilla pop-out menus): plain outline (Outline color) / primary marquee (flowing primary light band) / rainbow flow (three-color gradient flowing along the border).
ModernExpandMenu_SectionColorBorder=Border
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleMedicalCare=Apply MD3 to the medicine-care selector
ModernExpandMenu_Md3StyleMedicalCareDesc=When enabled, the medicine-care button group in Default Medicine Settings and the Health tab (No care / No medicine / Herbal / Industrial / Ultratech) becomes MD3 rounded slots: primary hover fill and primary outline for the selected one. Appearance only.
